{"parentUuid":"6cab573a-278c-4563-94ac-7dee8ec00d2b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01WD7z7UfPh6Kazbc3mmXhVC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"이제 전체 구조가 보입니다. OS 수준 기능적 MECE를 정리합니다.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Interactive-OS 기능적 MECE\\n\\n\`\`\`\\nInteractive-OS\\n├── 1. Data         — 뭘 담는가\\n├── 2. Command      — 뭘 하는가\\n├── 3. Navigation   — 어디로 가는가\\n├── 4. Selection    — 뭘 고르는가\\n├── 5. Mutation     — 뭘 바꾸는가\\n├── 6. Presentation — 어떻게 보이는가\\n└── 7. Composition  — 어떻게 조립하는가\\n\`\`\`\\n\\n### 1. Data — 뭘 담는가\\n\\n| 기능 | 소스 | 핵심 export |\\n|------|------|-------------|\\n| **정규화 저장소** | store/ | \`NormalizedData\`, \`Entity\`, \`ROOT_ID\`, \`createStore\` |\\n| **CRUD 연산** | store/ | \`addEntity\`, \`removeEntity\`, \`updateEntity\`, \`moveNode\` |\\n| **트리 조회** | store/ | \`getEntity\`, \`getChildren\`, \`getParent\`, \`getSlots\`, \`getSlotChildren\` |\\n| **부분 추출·병합** | store/ | \`extractSubtree\`, \`mergeSubtree\` |\\n| **Diff** | store/ | \`computeStoreDiff\`, \`applyDelta\` |\\n| **반응형 바인딩** | store/ | \`useStore\` |\\n\\n### 2. Command — 뭘 하는가\\n\\n| 기능 | 소스 | 핵심 export |\\n|------|------|-------------|\\n| **명령 정의** | engine/ | \`defineCommand\`, \`defineCommands\`, \`Command\`, \`BatchCommand\` |\\n| **실행 엔진** | engine/ | \`createCommandEngine\`, \`CommandEngine\` |\\n| **미들웨어** | engine/ | \`Middleware\`, \`ValidatorFn\` |\\n| **Undo/Redo** | plugins/history | \`history\`, \`undoCommand\`, \`redoCommand\` |\\n| **이벤트 구독** | engine/ | \`subscribe\`, \`DispatchEvent\`, \`UnhandledKeyEvent\` |\\n| **로깅** | engine/ | \`Logger\`, \`defaultLogger\` |\\n| **React 바인딩** | engine/ + primitives/ | \`useEngine\`, \`useCommand\`, \`useCommandBind\` |\\n\\n### 3. Navigation — 어디로 가는가\\n\\n| 기능 | 소스 | 핵심 export |\\n|------|------|-------------|\\n| **1D 탐색** | axis/navigate | \`navigate('vertical'\\\\|'horizontal')\`, \`FOCUS_ID\` |\\n| **2D 그리드** | axis/navigate | \`grid(columns)\`, \`GRID_COL_ID\`, \`gridCtx\` |\\n| **공간 탐색** | axis/navigate + plugins/spatial | \`navigate('spatial')\`, \`spatialAlgorithm\`, \`useSpatialNav\` |\\n| **Activedescendant** | axis/navigate | \`navigate('activedescendant')\` |\\n| **Tab 순환** | axis/tab | \`focusNextWrap\`, \`focusPrevWrap\` |\\n| **포커스 복구** | plugins/focusRecovery | \`focusRecovery\`, \`findFallbackFocus\` |\\n| **포커스 이력** | plugins/focusHistory | \`focusHistory\`, \`focusBackCommand\` |\\n| **스크롤 추적** | plugins/scroll, autoscroll | \`scroll\`, \`autoscroll\` |\\n| **가시성 필터** | engine/ | \`getVisibleNodes\`, \`VisibilityFilter\` |\\n| **URL 동기화** | plugins/urlSync | \`urlSync\`, \`getInitialFromUrl\` |\\n| **가상 스크롤** | plugins/virtualScroll | \`virtualScroll\`, \`useVirtualScroll\` |\\n\\n### 4. Selection — 뭘 고르는가\\n\\n| 기능 | 소스 | 핵심 export |\\n|------|------|-------------|\\n| **단일/다중 선택** | axis/select | \`selected('single'\\\\|'multiple')\`, \`SELECTION_ID\` |\\n| **셀 범위 선택** | axis/navigate | \`CELL_RANGE_ID\`, \`gridCellRangeCommands\` |\\n| **셀 드래그 선택** | plugins/cellDragSelect | \`cellDragSelect\` |\\n| **체크 토글** | axis/checked | \`checked()\`, \`CHECKED_ID\` |\\n| **선택→포커스 추종** | axis/select | \`selectionFollowsFocusMiddleware\` |\\n| **활성화** | axis/activate | \`activateCommands\`, \`activateHandler\` |\\n\\n### 5. Mutation — 뭘 바꾸는가\\n\\n| 기능 | 소스 | 핵심 export |\\n|------|------|-------------|\\n| **펼침/접힘** | axis/expand | \`expanded()\`, \`EXPANDED_ID\`, \`expandVisibilityFilter\` |\\n| **값 조정** | axis/value | \`value(range)\`, \`VALUE_ID\`, \`valueCommands\` |\\n| **인라인 편집** | axis/edit | \`edit()\`, \`EDIT_ID\`, \`editCommands\` |\\n| **셀 편집** | plugins/cellEdit | \`cellEdit\` |\\n| **이름 변경** | plugins/rename | \`rename\`, \`RENAME_ID\` |\\n| **팝업/오버레이** | axis/popup + overlay/ | \`popup(type)\`, \`POPUP_ID\`, \`useOverlay\`, \`layerStack\` |\\n| **CRUD 플러그인** | plugins/crud | \`crud\`, \`crudCommands\` |\\n| **클립보드** | plugins/clipboard | \`clipboard\`, \`COPY\`, \`CUT\`, \`PASTE\` + cell variants |\\n| **DnD** | plugins/dnd | \`dnd\`, \`dndCommands\` |\\n| **드래그 리사이즈** | plugins/dragResize | \`dragResize\`, \`keyboardResize\` |\\n| **폼 검증** | plugins/form | \`form\`, \`getFormErrors\`, \`isTouched\` |\\n| **검색 필터** | plugins/search | \`search\`, \`SEARCH_ID\`, \`matchesSearchFilter\` |\\n| **Typeahead** | plugins/typeahead | \`typeahead\`, \`findTypeaheadMatch\` |\\n| **스코프 진입** | plugins/scope | \`scope\`, \`SCOPE_ID\` |\\n\\n### 6. Presentation — 어떻게 보이는가\\n\\n| 기능 | 소스 | 핵심 export |\\n|------|------|-------------|\\n| **ARIA 속성 계산** | engine/ | \`computeNodeAriaProps\`, \`computeAllNodeLabels\` |\\n| **인스펙션** | engine/ | \`inspectToTree\`, \`storeToInspectorTree\` |\\n| **패턴 33종** | pattern/roles/ | accordion~windowSplitter (APG 1:1) |\\n| **UI 완성품 100+** | ui/ | Button, Dialog, TreeGrid, Table, Menu, ... |\\n| **인디케이터 25종** | ui/indicators/ | Check, Expand, Radio, Switch, Spinner, ... |\\n| **아이템 28종** | ui/items/ | ListItem, MenuItem, TabItem, TreeItem, ... |\\n| **셀 10종** | ui/cells/ | TextCell, BadgeCell, EditableCell, ... |\\n| **패널 3종** | ui/panels/ | Panel, SidePanel, SubmenuPanel |\\n| **컴포짓 5종** | ui/composites/ | FormSection, MasterDetail, SearchableList, StatGrid, StepWizard |\\n| **채팅 블록** | ui/chat/ | ChatFeed, TextBlock, CodeBlock, DiffBlock, ThinkingBlock |\\n| **A2UI 원격 렌더링** | ui/a2ui* | a2uiProtocol, a2uiRenderers, A2UISurface |\\n\\n### 7. Composition — 어떻게 조립하는가\\n\\n| 기능 | 소스 | 핵심 export |\\n|------|------|-------------|\\n| **패턴 합성** | pattern/ | \`composePattern(identity, axes[])\` |\\n| **플러그인 선언** | plugins/ | \`definePlugin(config)\` |\\n| **React 바인딩** | primitives/ | \`useAria\`, \`useAriaZone\`, \`useControlledAria\` |\\n| **Aria 컴포넌트** | primitives/ | \`Aria.Item\`, \`Aria.Cell\`, \`Aria.Editable\`, \`Aria.Panel\` |\\n| **라우트 키맵** | primitives/ | \`AriaRoute\`, \`defineRouteKey\`, \`useKeyMap\` |\\n| **글로벌 트랩** | primitives/ | \`useGlobalTrap\` |\\n| **레이아웃 엔진** | layout/ | \`definePage\`, \`FlatLayout\`, \`LayoutNode\` 11종 |\\n| **위젯 레지스트리** | layout/ | \`createWidgetRegistry\`, \`resolveWidget\` |\\n| **도메인 컨텍스트** | layout/ | \`createDomainContext\` |\\n| **워크스페이스** | plugins/workspaceStore | \`workspace\`, \`openTab\`, \`splitAndAddTab\` |\\n| **Zod 스키마** | plugins/zodSchema | \`zodSchema\` (구조 검증) |\\n\\n---\\n\\n### MECE 검증\\n\\n\`\`\`\\n        Data  Cmd  Nav  Sel  Mut  Pres  Comp\\nstore    ●                              \\nengine        ●                   ●     \\naxis              ●    ●    ●          \\nplugins       ●   ●    ●    ●          ●\\npattern                           ●    ●\\nprimitives                             ●\\nui                               ●     \\nlayout                                 ●\\noverlay                     ●          \\n\`\`\`\\n\\n- **ME (상호배타)**: 각 카테고리가 다른 질문에 답한다 (담는가/하는가/가는가/고르는가/바꾸는가/보이는가/조립하는가)\\n- **CE (전체포괄)**: 모든 export가 7개 중 하나에 배치됨. 누락 없음\\n\\n핵심 인사이트: OS의 본질은 **Data × Command × 5개 축(Nav/Sel/Mut) × Pattern합성 × UI표면**의 곱집합입니다. 레이어가 아니라 **차원**으로 보는 게 더 정확합니다."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8893,"cache_read_input_tokens":53056,"output_tokens":2801,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8893,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":2801,"cache_read_input_tokens":53056,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8893,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8893},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Ca76qMkPTYZfLxDQYyYiq","type":"assistant","uuid":"bfabdc6b-1a18-4b68-9ff1-97bc425f2835","timestamp":"2026-04-16T08:04:03.430Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/user/Desktop/aria/src/interactive-os","sessionId":"51beda1a-c65b-472b-8673-531f941c0c34","version":"2.1.110","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-sniffing-crayon"}
