{"parentUuid":"f773dac1-ac5d-423a-afe2-da716dc5e322","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KPiNBqWUzKANwS3bmayKtb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"전체를 읽었습니다. 각 axis 파일의 **분리 경계**가 보입니다.\\n\\n## core/에 들어갈 것 vs axis/에 남을 것\\n\\n각 파일마다 깔끔하게 나뉩니다:\\n\\n| axis 파일 | core/로 이동 (상태 계약) | axis/에 남음 (축 행동) |\\n|-----------|------------------------|---------------------|\\n| \`navigate.ts\` | \`FOCUS_ID\`, \`focusCommands\`, \`GRID_COL_ID\`, \`gridColCommands\`, \`CELL_RANGE_ID\`, \`gridCellRangeCommands\` + handler들 | \`navigate()\`, \`grid()\`, \`navigateCtxFactory()\`, \`gridCtx()\`, \`groupJump()\` |\\n| \`select.ts\` | \`SELECTION_ID\`, \`SELECTION_ANCHOR_ID\`, \`selectionCommands\` + handler들 | \`selected()\`, \`selectedCtx()\`, \`selectAndAnchor\`, \`selectionFollowsFocusMiddleware()\` |\\n| \`expand.ts\` | \`EXPANDED_ID\`, \`expandCommands\` + handler들 | \`expanded()\`, \`expandedCtx()\`, \`expandVisibilityFilter\` |\\n| \`checked.ts\` | \`CHECKED_ID\`, \`checkedCommands\` + handler들 | \`checked()\`, \`checkedCtx()\` |\\n| \`edit.ts\` | \`EDIT_ID\`, \`editCommands\` + handler들 | \`edit()\`, \`editCtx()\` |\\n| \`popup.ts\` | \`POPUP_ID\`, \`popupCommands\` + handler들 | \`popup()\`, \`popupCtx()\`, \`popupVisibilityFilter\` |\\n| \`value.ts\` | \`VALUE_ID\`, \`valueCommands\` + handler들 | \`value()\`, \`valueCtx()\` |\\n| \`activate.ts\` | \`activateCommands\` | \`activateHandler\` |\\n\\n### core/ 파일 구조\\n\\n\`\`\`\\ncore/\\n  focusCommands.ts       ← FOCUS_ID + focusCommands + gridColCommands + gridCellRangeCommands\\n  selectionCommands.ts   ← SELECTION_ID + selectionCommands\\n  expandCommands.ts      ← EXPANDED_ID + expandCommands\\n  checkedCommands.ts     ← CHECKED_ID + checkedCommands\\n  editCommands.ts        ← EDIT_ID + editCommands\\n  popupCommands.ts       ← POPUP_ID + popupCommands\\n  valueCommands.ts       ← VALUE_ID + valueCommands\\n  activateCommands.ts    ← activateCommands\\n  index.ts               ← re-export all + coreRegistry\\n\`\`\`\\n\\n### 의존 그래프\\n\\n\`\`\`\\nstore/  →  engine/  →  core/  →  axis/  →  pattern/\\n                         ↑\\n                       plugins/ (여기서 import)\\n\`\`\`\\n\\n### 주의점: axis 내부 cross-import\\n\\n- \`select.ts\`가 \`focusCommands\`를 import (extend에서 focus 이동)\\n- \`popup.ts\`가 \`focusCommands\`를 import (open 시 focus 이동)\\n\\n이것들은 core/ 도입 후 \`core/focusCommands\`에서 가져오면 자연스럽게 해결됩니다.\\n\\n이 구조로 실행할까요?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13685,"cache_read_input_tokens":115021,"output_tokens":871,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13685,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":871,"cache_read_input_tokens":115021,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13685,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13685},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Ca795oP7ZK8rJqsaaNPxH","type":"assistant","uuid":"6549b421-b2d5-4316-8ca2-010ac0f00b6d","timestamp":"2026-04-16T08:32:58.962Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/user/Desktop/aria/src/interactive-os","sessionId":"51beda1a-c65b-472b-8673-531f941c0c34","version":"2.1.110","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-sniffing-crayon"}
